flowchart TD
  Browser[Next.js 16 React authenticated workspace] --> API[Django 6 DRF tenant scoped API]
  API --> Auth[Password token auth / configured Google OAuth PKCE handoff]
  Auth --> Business[Business + membership + editable starter profile]
  Business --> Profile[Immutable BusinessProfileVersion]
  Profile --> Assessment[Assessment reuse under business lock]
  Assessment --> Orchestrator[AssessmentOrchestrator / LLMFirstStrategy / completion facade]
  Orchestrator --> Understand[Business understanding]
  Understand --> Known[Requested assessment snapshot / description / saved answers / canonical aliases]
  Known --> RuleGaps[Published rule AST missing facts / contextual source discovery gaps]
  Knowledge --> RuleGaps
  RuleGaps --> QuestionPolicy[question_policy v5: identity dedup / known False and zero preserved / grounded wording / impact ranking]
  QuestionPolicy --> Questions[Saved assessment scoped plan: zero to five questions / deferred gaps]
  StarterSuggestions[Editable starter suggestions / not confirmed facts] --> Questions
  Questions --> IntakeAdapter[questionnaire.py compact lifecycle / question_types.py contract]
  LegacyQuestions[Persisted older question plans] --> QuestionPolicy
  IntakeAdapter --> Answers[Validated confirmed answers / selected snapshot only / HP unit]
  Answers --> Context[Canonical enriched context]
  Context --> Remote[Existing ComplianceRAG POST retrieval/search]
  Remote --> Filter[Validate metadata / official source / jurisdiction]
  Filter --> Retrieved[External excerpts retained as context]
  Remote -->|empty or failed| Available[Business facts + persisted context]
  Context --> Query[RegulatoryQueryPlanner]
  Query --> Search[SerpApi Google search.json / SEARCH_API]
  Search --> URLs[Candidate URLs: snippets are not evidence]
  URLs --> Policy[Official domain + DNS + redirects + destination checks]
  Policy --> Crawlee[Crawlee 1.7.2 acquisition router]
  Crawlee --> HTTP[HttpCrawler HTTPX / CRAWLEE_HTTP]
  HTTP -->|thin HTML only / remaining budget| BrowserAcquire[PlaywrightCrawler Chromium / CRAWLEE_BROWSER]
  Crawlee -->|explicit browser| BrowserAcquire
  HTTP --> Capture[Validate MIME / text / blocked pages / title / hashes]
  BrowserAcquire --> Capture
  Capture --> Persisted[Source + RetrievedDocument / normalized text + capture metadata]
  Crawlee -->|failure| Recovery[Same profile persisted capture recovery]
  Recovery --> Available
  Persisted --> Extract[LLM extraction: exact quotes / supported procedure detail]
  Extract --> Quarantine[CandidateRequirement + UNVERIFIED Evidence]
  Quarantine --> Review[Authorized reviewer / AST validation / audit]
  Review --> Knowledge[Published RequirementDefinition + RuleVersion + VERIFIED Evidence]
  Knowledge --> Local[Preserved verified evidence token overlap retrieval]
  Local --> Coverage{Sufficient published rule coverage?}
  Coverage -->|yes| Engine[Deterministic AST / TRUE FALSE UNKNOWN / typed product scope / jurisdiction / evidence]
  Coverage -->|insufficient or partial| Guidance[Structured contextual LLM guidance]
  Profile --> Engine
  Engine --> Decisions[DecisionRun + DecisionResult]
  Retrieved --> Guidance
  Persisted --> Guidance
  Available --> Guidance
  Decisions --> Guidance
  Decisions --> ReadModels[requirements/selectors.py / recorded fact trace / bound exact citations / cautious legacy scope]
  Persisted --> ExactSource[evidence/presentation.py exact evidence URL / homepage and login rejection / application portal separate]
  Knowledge --> ExactSource
  ExactSource --> ReadModels
  ReadModels --> Workspace[Normal assessment workspace]
  Guidance --> Schema[Nested schema / source identity / legal detail / current snapshot facts validated inside provider attempts]
  Schema --> Followups[Typed zero to five follow-ups / grounded wording / known fact dedup]
  Schema --> Saved[WorkspaceGuidance / LLM_FALLBACK_RESULT / no legal publication]
  Saved --> CacheGuard[Grounding policy1 / selected snapshot + recorded passages / validate saved projection on read]
  CacheGuard --> Workspace
  CacheGuard -->|invalid history| Cautious[Exclude unsafe guidance / no provider or historical write on GET]
  Review --> Reevaluate[Reevaluate linked assessments on publication]
  Reevaluate --> Decisions
  Workspace --> Compliance[Compliance: decisions + contextual suggestions]
  Workspace --> Documents[Assessment-profile scoped preparation checklist / optional when unresolved / real uploads]
  Workspace --> Workflow[Assessment-profile scoped cases / idempotent steps / reviewer treatment]
  Workspace --> Support[Versioned source projections / schemes and standards / contextual quality planning]
  SchemeCapture[Scheme acquisition / real text only / failed capture stays failed] --> SchemeVersion[SchemeVersion PENDING_REVIEW / criteria AST / captured source]
  SchemeVersion --> SchemeGuard[Authored fixture fingerprint quarantine / preserve history / no verification promotion]
  SchemeGuard --> SchemeMatch[Typed eligibility / explicit negatives / currentness / selected snapshot]
  SchemeMatch --> Support
  ReadModels --> Standards[Concrete product predicate / evidence-bound mandatory reference / candidate or review state]
  Standards --> Mandate[Shared standard mandatory linkage / optional checklist when unknown or voluntary]
  Mandate --> Documents
  Standards --> Support
  Workspace --> Dates[Calendar / alerts only from recorded dates]
  Workspace --> Dashboard[Data driven metrics / actions / no made up readiness]
  Workspace --> DB[(Runtime PostgreSQL / assessment scope / tenant permissions)]
  Auth --> WorkspaceState[Race safe UserWorkspaceState get_or_create / business selection]
  WorkspaceState --> Workspace
  Persisted --> DB
  Decisions --> DB
  Saved --> DB

  Understand --> Providers[Existing LLM provider registry]
  Questions --> Providers
  Extract --> Providers
  Guidance --> Providers
  Providers --> Pool[Gemini primary / healthy round robin cursor / process local cooldown]
  Pool -->|request starts at next eligible slot| G1[Gemini Provider 1]
  Pool -->|request starts at next eligible slot| G2[Gemini Provider 2]
  Pool -->|request starts at next eligible slot| G3[Gemini Provider 3]
  G1 -->|failure or quota / next eligible| G2
  G2 -->|failure or quota / next eligible| G3
  G3 -->|failure / untried eligible slots in bounded rotated order| Remaining[Finish each eligible Gemini slot once]
  Remaining -->|all unavailable or exhausted| OpenAI[OpenAI final fallback / reverse loop disabled]
  G1 --> Valid[Validated completion returned to application]
  G2 --> Valid
  G3 --> Valid
  OpenAI --> Valid
  OpenAI -->|failure| Error[Controlled final failure / inputs retained / retry]
  Error -->|understanding only| Heuristic[Local description heuristic / no invented geography or legal applicability]
  Providers --> Telemetry[Safe provider / slot / model / attempt / latency / token / failure telemetry]
  Valid --> Orchestrator
  Providers --> JSONMode[Structured Gemini requests use native application/json output mode]
  Orchestrator --> AnalysisState[Saved real stages and durations / completion state]
  Telemetry --> PhaseTiming[Wall time for joined search / capture attempts / retrieval / evaluation / LLM / committed workspace writes]
  PhaseTiming --> AnalysisState
  API --> AnswerTiming[Answer submission duration in response metadata / no provider call]
  API --> StatusRead[Analysis status GET is read-only / no orchestration or provider call]
  AnalysisState --> StatusRead
  API --> Admin[Superuser atomic user and business creation / same starter selector]
  Admin --> Business
  API --> CaseReview[Assigned reviewer operational decisions / saved audit]
  CaseReview --> Workflow
  Embedding[Existing embedding interfaces + pgvector extension] -. no local vector index implied .-> Local
